 "name": "Consent Name System Community Group",
 "is_closed": true,
 "creation-date": "2022-01-21",
 "description": "Our mission: design and build the 3rd generation of the CNS to be deployed globally as a free commons, a sibling to the DNS.\r\nOur scope: a hyper-cube bitmap that contains 1's and 0's for ALL GLEIF (businesses/agencies), Jurisdictions, and Legal Uses of Data, set initially by jurisdictions, then businesses/agencies, and finally by data subjects.\r\nOur deliverables: essential documents and code to stand-up a working CNS as an open source server. Gen 2 docs and video: https://bit.ly/FalconCNS",
